  The reel_script states the cleaning of the site happened ('ஏற்கனவே சுத்தம் செய்யப்பட்டுள்ளது'), which is in the article, but the slides_spec's 'அளவீடு செய்யும் பணிகள்' is described as the shelter preparation work; the article's measurement work is for the planned structures, so framing it as shelter work start conflicts with the article's wording.
